                  <div style="font-size:10.5px; color:var(--color-neutral-600); padding-top:9px; border-top:1px solid var(--color-neutral-900);">Showing 5 of 94 confirmed · every reservation carries campaign, ad set, ad, UTM and sales-owner fields from the CRM</div>
